<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>“Whosoever cometh” need not delay,</l><l>Now the door is open, enter while you may;</l><l>Jesus is the true, the only Living Way:</l><l>“Whosoever will may come!”</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>“Whosoever will!” the promise is secure;</l><l>“Whosoever will,” forever must endure;</l><l>“Whosoever will!” ’tis life forevermore;</l><l>“Whosoever will may come.”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
